{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fae363bebce5b7db4506a67888bca4ee0a4bb5e9b0281e44039e76abab9d1fa5", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。\nすごいって聞こえたんですけど、何かありましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n我好像听到有人说“好厉害”，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "31ab05c467fe78d009f81a7f3c77372e7ab576a89934061a6728e2d3f1f9ebff", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nえへへ、聞こえちゃいましたか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n嘿嘿，被您听到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "07429812eaffd162036413b5bb426e439adb9a8a2aea8916532b94db373be9b7", "ja": "音無先輩に借りた少女マンガが、とっても素敵で！\n漫画家さんってすごいなぁ～って思ってたんです♪", "zh": "音无前辈借给我的少女漫画特别精彩！让我觉得漫画家真厉害啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d5e6a8c60585947d7074b659ea7db87a14842c2a02dcfa304a9b980ba9bfef87", "ja": "なるほど、漫画家さんですか。確かに、\n絵だけじゃなくて、お話も考えないとですもんね。", "zh": "原来如此，是漫画家啊。确实，不只是画画，还得构思故事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fe7cdeba6d17bbf47f63127589bb745353e542e99e1721fdc5e6d67e4f6e79b1", "ja": "中には、お話と絵を別々の人が\n分担しているマンガもあるそうですけど……。", "zh": "听说也有些漫画是由不同的人分别负责故事和绘画的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "f888f023763e7177a014382b68d9880bde26306a2db131c5e93aa5ba950f530b", "ja": "そうみたいです！　マンガを作るには、\nいろいろな技術が必要なんですね～。", "zh": "好像是这样！要创作漫画，需要掌握各种各样的技能呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "c39f70643b4cdc0db3a7ba51f40091de9e97917dae3095ee8b46568494ac1f41", "ja": "あっ、マンガと言えば……！　社長さんが\n{$P$}さんを呼んでましたよ！", "zh": "啊，说到漫画……！社长刚才叫{$P$}先生过去了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "404c2a9ef1b2e9585a185ae61171ae1c0a52c5ddddd6b6f6914e04dce4793c05", "ja": "えっ、社長が？　なんだろう……。\nわかりました、行ってきます！", "zh": "咦，社长叫我？不知道是什么事……\n我知道了，这就去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "513142f6fba7e62f484d5ee537c4c15e84a7aae91b90ba11b29c16a9603472b9", "ja": "はーい、お気をつけて～！\nいってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "好——路上小心哦～！\n慢走——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "ed86d67cf971bcd3c89afe4977c4d7e6d8e9a2e6f54ca0ed8a282d181d8eeeb0", "ja": "ふむ。これが歴代の表紙か。\nそれにしても、すごい数だね。", "zh": "嗯，这些就是历代的封面啊。\n话说回来，数量真多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "17eda4fb54a76370f7f36bc809ea40c5b61d8c30236296a55893fd414d8fbd2e", "ja": "私が子どもの頃からあった雑誌ですから……。\nこうして見ると、歴史を感じますねぇ。", "zh": "这本杂志从我小时候就有了……。\n这样看来，真的能感受到它的历史呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "4979f87e54ff71e6662830e31b47a9c583d7fdf5c3596e63ae9deddaf5ea7e07", "ja": "これとか……あと、これも持ってました！\n懐かしいなぁ。私、このマンガ大好きだったんです♪", "zh": "像这个……还有这个，我以前也有过！真让人怀念啊。我以前特别喜欢这部漫画的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "5f510418ff08193c8744e8d256663826c8f346eae43bb36c01fe800beaf34d1d", "ja": "主人公の片想い相手の男の子が、とってもかっこ\nよくて。何度ときめいたことか……うふ、うふふ♪", "zh": "主人公暗恋的那个男孩子，真的帅气\n极了。不知让我心动过多少次了……嘻、嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0836bd2d020e68eca2d7ae86eb20efd5f8ecdf6819addd064ad4b3e27ac3e6c1", "ja": "あの……社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です。\nお取り込み中でしたでしょうか？", "zh": "那个……社长、音无女士，辛苦了。\n请问两位正忙着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "c722d62ce60cadc2509431bbe2efee29143fccd53dac7c2388423207c7f1e6c2", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん！？\nいけない、私ったら、妄想してしまって……。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生！？\n糟糕，我一不小心就开始胡思乱想了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "ed6089c679bd900dbd9d99870187e94a427dbec3afd859395e0a069bb037246f", "ja": "やあ、君。待っていたよ！\n今、音無君と資料を見ていたところでね。", "zh": "嗨，你来了。我正等着你呢！\n刚才正和音无同学一起看资料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "86a4ccd3740cffad748935883b7e39c699c3eb4a052d0001c4c275eaed8ddcc8", "ja": "資料……？\nあれ？　これ、『りるきゃん』の表紙ですね。", "zh": "资料……？咦？这是《りるきゃん》的封面吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "832c34b7e6acdebf18fabfa55e0841529ea140ae9557c8057463d44cafe6ca87", "ja": "うむ。以前、伊吹翼君達がイメージモデルを務めた、\n少女マンガ雑誌『りるきゃん』の表紙だ。", "zh": "嗯。这是以前由伊吹翼她们担任形象模特的少女漫画杂志《Lil’Can》的封面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "05c4609865a757970951a360c545b2feb4dc0993db5a876027c28bcbbb2cf4c0", "ja": "やっぱり！\nでも、今とは随分、雰囲気が違うような……？", "zh": "果然是！\n不过，感觉和现在的风格差挺多的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "ee58411659ece3aa0d1d06d76ff297e3361edec7e9071f1a2236e7063d52e713", "ja": "流石は{$P$}さん、鋭いですね！\nこれ、歴代『りるきゃん』の表紙なんですよ。", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生，真敏锐啊！\n这些是历代《りるきゃん》的封面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "dfe060b7632bef99753ada69b5cdf999012ad9b644a9d3a37cbf8987183a51ad", "ja": "すごい……！　こんなに沢山あるんですね！\nでも、これが資料というのは……？", "zh": "好厉害……！居然有这么多！\n不过，这些是资料……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "c6a8ea3de5561d49f1a8ece9233d8879ab4fe91ed82f00f051169b7d497c62d4", "ja": "実は、『りるきゃん』が創刊50周年を迎えてね。\n大きな展示会イベントを開催することになったらしい。", "zh": "其实，《Little Candy》迎来了创刊50周年。\n听说他们决定举办一场大型展会活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "f380589b849221f695a8ade3f452dd41a15923996641d5fad40e1fb16685ca54", "ja": "そこで、以前イメージモデルを務めた3人に、\nゲスト出演してほしいという依頼があった！", "zh": "于是，收到了希望曾担任形象代言人的3人作为嘉宾出演的邀请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "34b783fa34a6d74a4ed8aedaee9004b45b5386ea20b3a21395f360ba240c859d", "ja": "50周年記念展示会イベントの、ゲスト……！\n大きな仕事ですね。3人とも、喜ぶと思います！", "zh": "50周年纪念展活动的嘉宾……！\n这可是份大工作呢。我想她们3个人也一定会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "8d54cb35c26f2b8a78e359916633bb5c64aebc055e81409abc64c217ed01651b", "ja": "どんなイベントになるんでしょう？\nまた想像が膨らんじゃうかも……ふふっ♪", "zh": "会变成什么样的活动呢？\n说不定又会忍不住开始畅想了……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "34b7b8c21008c1697fbb13b7519c010216ce888e2de9c8f3e0853cb48ae4984a", "ja": "マンガ好きな音無君も、\n期待せずにはいられないみたいだね。", "zh": "喜欢漫画的音无君，看来也忍不住期待起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "faa1c2b508f779a49207361b9fac745c18276ad9371507eb7a66002e358516da", "ja": "はい♪　今回のイベント、\n一マンガファンとしても、楽しみにしていますね！", "zh": "是的♪这次的活动，我作为一名漫画迷，也很期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5bb3b00f048a4dd90e3ad03998d45d3505b4ee11ed1c6f9e8c451e0acf1ce383", "ja": "期待に応えられるよう頑張ります！　何かあったら、\n音無さんにもお手伝い、お願いしますね！", "zh": "我会努力不辜负您的期待！如果有什么事，也请音无小姐帮忙哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "00ac6816700881ddca3b89aece05a40aefe1e13fe434c90a6065c28e9585799a", "ja": "ええ、もちろん！　私にできることがあれば、\nぜひお手伝いさせてください。", "zh": "当然，没问题！如果有我能做到的事，请一定让我帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "a14a74cb63f4912b05e2410903d0cce4c2f72fd2aeb79ec871fcd65cb84db2dc", "ja": "それじゃあ、君。\n今回のイベント、よろしく頼んだよ！", "zh": "那么，就拜托你了。\n这次活动也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "874e073705abae0c4babbf57a56eeb22c4275c263d47c59246fc065d1dfd3bac", "ja": "はい、任せてください！　記念すべきイベントを\nみんなと一緒に盛り上げてきます！", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！我会和大家一起让这场值得纪念的活动热闹起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0371_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "30011cb02d3cf3213dbbc183062865e3b9ab5b92f85e204845e907e9e6daa0da", "ja": "（早速、みんなを集めてミーティングだな。\n忙しくなるぞ……！）", "zh": "（马上把大家召集起来开个会吧。\n要忙起来了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
